The shooting took place in the " [:a {:href "/venues/276"} "sports park in Versailles"] ", while swimming was held in the " [:a {:href "/venues/269"} "Tourelles Swimming Pool"] ". Fencing was contested on 14 July in Colombes, north of Paris. The riding was held on 16 July in " [:a {:href "/venues/275"} "Fontainebleau"] ", while the cross-country began near the " [:a {:href "/venues/265"} "Olympic Stadium in Colombes"] ", and finished on the track there. There was no International Federation governing modern pentathlon in 1924, and would not be until 1948, so the event was conducted by the French National Olympic Committee."] "\n\n"] "\n\n" [:h2 {} "Events"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {} "Status"] "\n" [:th {} "Date"] "\n" [:th {} "Participants"] "\n" [:th {} "NOCs"] "\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/50018"} "Individual, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "12 – 17 July 1924"] "\n" [:td {} "38"] "\n" [:td {} "11"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {:class "border-top"} "\n38 (38/0)\n"] "\n" [:td {:class "border-top"} "\n11 (11/0)\n"] "\n"] "\n"]] "\n\n\n" [:h2 {} "Medals"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {:colspan "2"} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] "\n" [:th {:colspan "2"} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] "\n" [:th {:colspan "2"} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] "\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:td {:class "top"} [:a {:href "/results/50018"} "Individual, Men"]] "\n" [:td {:style "vertical-align: top"} [:a {:href "/athletes/35073"} "Bo Lindman"]] [:td {:style "vertical-align: top"} [:a {:href "/countries/SWE"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/SWE.png"}] "SWE"]] "\n" [:td {:style "vertical-align: top"} [:a {:href "/athletes/35052"} "Gustaf